{"version":1,"content":"<p>【排他手段 😓】半導體研究機構 SemiAnalysis 近日披露，NVIDIA 傳出對合作夥伴採取強硬排他手段，已拒絕多家新興雲端服務業者參加即將在德國柏林舉行的 GTC 大會。</p><p>消息指出，相關廠商被拒於門外並非技術規格未符合標準，而是因為這些業者在其雲端平台上引入了 AMD GPU 以及 Google TPU 等競爭對手的晶片運算方案。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:03.695866+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T11:14:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T17:37:35.810703+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684399+00:00","content_hash":"a512151c6332acacd133f560d53a3f4b049b21a1ffaf10266af8c99e9c85c149","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}